    {
      "id": "W7221675142",
      "doi": "10.1002/adom.71910",
      "title": "Frequency‐Resolving Terahertz Detection via NbGeSb Topological Semimetal Integrated With Multi‐Scale 3D‐Printed Metastructures",
      "authors": [
        "Wenzhe Wang",
        "Guodong Jia",
        "Zuoang Sun",
        "Min Zhang",
        "Bingyuan Zhang",
        "Feilong Gao",
        "Ling Li",
        "Qi Song"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Advanced Optical Materials",
      "venue_abbr": "Adv. Opt. Mater.",
      "rank_label": "未匹配 CIE 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "localized surface plasmon resonance",
        "field enhancement",
        "noise equivalent power",
        "terahertz receivers"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1002/adom.71910",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/da7693aa-b4e9-42b7-809d-e81c4428fa1b.html",
      "summary": "该研究将NbGeSb拓扑半金属薄膜与多尺度3D打印亚波长超结构集成，利用尺寸相关局域表面等离激元共振实现0.1–0.4 THz范围的选择性场约束。有限差分仿真显示，大面积器件在0.1 THz处的峰值场增强超过10³。摘要报告，优化器件在室温、11.5 V偏压下的响应度为42.231 A/W，噪声等效功率为1.191 pW/Hz¹ᐟ²；太赫兹时域光谱确认了频率选择性调制，最强响应位于约0.1 THz。激光和磁场调制分别增强了频率选择性对比度，二者同时作用仅作为未来方案提出。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
